  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Local Action to End Child Marriage - GNB</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building on the UK&#x2019;s investment in global efforts to tackle child marriage, this component will focus on grassroots support to deepen and scale up our results to date. It will focus on grassroots and girl-centred advocacy and programming. FCDO investment GNB will support the capacity development of national civil society coalitions and youth-led movements in focus countries, as well as the UK&#x2019;s increased influence on harmful practices at the multilateral level. The partnership also offers strategic opportunities for Posts to partner with GNB to amplify their advocacy to national governments.</narrative>
  </description>
